"<div class=\"brand-bar\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"brand-logo\"><div class=\"brand-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div></div>\n<header class=\"lk-hd\"><div class=\"lk-topic\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 20l1-4.2L16.2 4.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 2.3 0l.9.9a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 0 2.3L8.2 19z\"/><path d=\"M14.5 6.4l3.1 3.1\"/></svg></div><div class=\"lk-kicker\">Wiederholung</div><div class=\"lk-big\">R1</div><h1>통합 복습 1</h1><div class=\"lk-de\">Wiederholung 1 · Lektion 01–11</div><div class=\"lk-intro\">Lektion 01부터 11까지 배운 문법을 섞어서 풀어요.<br>여러 과의 문법이 한 문장에 함께 나와요. 기본 7 · 중간 5 · 도전 4 문제예요.<div class=\"x-goals\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">이 복습에서 확인할 것</div><div class=\"x-goal\">관사와 격, 인칭대명사를 문장 속에서 함께 골라요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">동사 활용과 화법조동사·분리동사의 문장 괄호를 확인해요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">kein과 nicht, 시간 표현을 섞어서 써요</div></div><div class=\"x-goals\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">풀이 방법</div><div class=\"x-goal\">보기를 고르거나, 빈칸에 쓰거나, 단어를 눌러 문장을 만들어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">빈칸 옆 괄호와 한국어 뜻이 힌트예요. 대문자와 소문자는 구별하지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">단어 배열에는 문장부호가 없어요. 문법에 맞는 어순이면 모두 정답이에요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">바꿔 쓰기는 문장 전체를 써요. 쉼표와 마침표는 채점하지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">틀린 곳 찾기는 문장에서 틀린 단어 하나를 눌러요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">푼 답은 이 기기에 저장돼요. 새로고침하거나 앱을 업데이트해도 남아 있어요</div></div></div></header>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge review-badge\">기본</span><span class=\"sub-title\">기본 문제 · 배운 내용을 그대로 확인해요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"708852ab85\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Ich habe <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Bruder und zwei Schwestern.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">a) einem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">b) ein</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">c) einen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">d) eine</button></div><div class=\"qe\">Bruder는 남성이고 haben의 4격 목적어예요 → einen (3과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"7848a1ac9f\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;können&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Wir <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(können)</span> heute leider nicht kommen.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리는 오늘 아쉽게도 못 와요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Wir <b>können</b> heute leider nicht kommen.</div>wir와 함께 쓰는 können이에요. 본동사 kommen은 끝에 와요 (10과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"f17f2f2db7\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> <span class=\"qblank\"></span> arbeitet ihr? – In Ulsan.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">a) Woher</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">b) Wer</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">c) Wohin</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">d) Wo</button></div><div class=\"qe\">있는 곳은 wo로 물어요 (6과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"3e42721e5a\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;unsere&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> Das sind <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(wir · 소유관사)</span> Fahrräder.</div><div class=\"qko\">이것들이 우리 자전거예요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Das sind <b>unsere</b> Fahrräder.</div>wir의 소유관사 unser, 복수 1격이라 unsere예요 (8과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"83cb213bb3\" class=\"qi qx\" data-t=\"err\" data-x=\"1\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> 틀린 단어를 하나 눌러요.</div><div class=\"qko\">그는 독일어를 아주 잘해요.</div><div class=\"qtok\" lang=\"de\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"0\">Er</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"1\">sprecht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"2\">sehr</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"3\">gut</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"4\">Deutsch.</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">고친 문장 · <b>Er spricht sehr gut Deutsch.</b></div>sprechen은 er에서 e → i로 바뀌어요 (5과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"fd534164e4\" class=\"qi qt\" data-t=\"tr\" data-a=\"[&quot;Wir haben keinen Garten.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">6.</strong> kein으로 부정하는 문장으로 바꿔 쓰세요.</div><div class=\"qsrc\" lang=\"de\">Wir haben einen Garten.</div><textarea class=\"qtr\" rows=\"2\" lang=\"de\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-label=\"바꿔 쓴 문장 6\"></textarea><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Wir haben keinen Garten.</b></div>부정관사가 붙은 명사는 kein으로 부정해요. 남성 4격 → keinen (9과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"438889ef67\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">7.</strong> Die Führung beginnt <span class=\"qblank\"></span> halb acht.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">a) um</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">b) am</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">c) an</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">d) im</button></div><div class=\"qe\">시각 앞에는 um이에요 (7과).</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">중간</span><span class=\"sub-title\">중간 문제 · 조건이 한두 개 더 붙어요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"62c4b1279a\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">8.</strong> Kommst du heute mit? – Leider <span class=\"qblank\"></span>.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">a) kann nicht ich</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">b) nicht kann ich</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">c) kann ich nicht</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">d) ich kann nicht</button></div><div class=\"qe\">Leider가 첫 자리를 차지하면 동사 kann이 두 번째, 주어 ich가 그 뒤예요. nicht는 맨 끝이에요 (6·9·10과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"b571773261\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;mach&quot;,&quot;mache&quot;],[&quot;zu&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">9.</strong> Bitte <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(zumachen)</span> das Fenster <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\">!</div><div class=\"qko\">창문 좀 닫아 줘! (du에게)</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Bitte <b>mach</b> das Fenster <b>zu</b>!</div>du 명령형은 어간만 써요. 분리 접두어 zu는 문장 끝으로 가요 (5·11과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"aabca2c79f\" class=\"qi qx\" data-t=\"err\" data-x=\"5\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">10.</strong> 틀린 단어를 하나 눌러요.</div><div class=\"qko\">하기 싫어? – 아니, 하고 싶어.</div><div class=\"qtok\" lang=\"de\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"0\">Hast</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"1\">du</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"2\">keine</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"3\">Lust?</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"4\">–</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"5\">Ja,</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"6\">ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"7\">habe</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"8\">Lust.</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">고친 문장 · <b>Hast du keine Lust? – Doch, ich habe Lust.</b></div>부정 의문문에 긍정으로 대답할 때는 Doch예요 (9과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"685232a5b3\" class=\"qi qt\" data-t=\"tr\" data-a=\"[&quot;Du nimmst den Aufzug.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">11.</strong> 주어를 du로 바꿔 쓰세요.</div><div class=\"qsrc\" lang=\"de\">Ich nehme den Aufzug.</div><textarea class=\"qtr\" rows=\"2\" lang=\"de\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-label=\"바꿔 쓴 문장 11\"></textarea><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Du nimmst den Aufzug.</b></div>nehmen은 du에서 nimmst로 바뀌어요 (5과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"fab7398a54\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Sie bringt morgen ihren Bruder nicht mit&quot;,&quot;Morgen bringt sie ihren Bruder nicht mit&quot;,&quot;Ihren Bruder bringt sie morgen nicht mit&quot;,&quot;Sie bringt ihren Bruder morgen nicht mit&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">12.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">그녀는 내일 남동생을 데려오지 않아요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">mit</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">bringt</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">nicht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">ihren</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Bruder</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">morgen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">Sie</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Sie bringt morgen ihren Bruder nicht mit.</b></div>동사 bringt는 두 번째 자리, 분리 접두어 mit는 끝, nicht는 mit 바로 앞이에요 (6·9·11과).</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">도전</span><span class=\"sub-title\">도전 문제 · 함정과 예외까지 따져 봐요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"39bb44b989\" class=\"qi qx\" data-t=\"err\" data-x=\"3\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">13.</strong> 틀린 단어를 하나 눌러요.</div><div class=\"qko\">내일 나는 그에게 그 카드를 보내요.</div><div class=\"qtok\" lang=\"de\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"0\">Morgen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"1\">schicke</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"2\">ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"3\">ihn</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"4\">die</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"5\">Karte.</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">고친 문장 · <b>Morgen schicke ich ihm die Karte.</b></div>'그에게'는 3격 ihm이에요. ihn은 4격이에요 (4과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"5716992faf\" class=\"qi qt\" data-t=\"tr\" data-a=\"[&quot;Sie kann die Küche aufräumen.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">14.</strong> können을 넣고 주어를 sie(그녀)로 바꿔 쓰세요.</div><div class=\"qsrc\" lang=\"de\">Ich räume die Küche auf.</div><textarea class=\"qtr\" rows=\"2\" lang=\"de\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-label=\"바꿔 쓴 문장 14\"></textarea><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Sie kann die Küche aufräumen.</b></div>화법조동사 kann이 두 번째 자리, 분리동사 aufräumen은 원형 그대로 끝에 와요 (10·11과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"9ebfc5340a\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">15.</strong> Welcher Satz ist richtig?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">a) Hier ihr dürft nicht essen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">b) Ihr dürft hier nicht essen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">c) Ihr dürft hier essen nicht.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">d) Ihr nicht dürft hier essen.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">화법조동사는 두 번째, 원형은 끝, nicht는 원형 바로 앞이에요 (6·9·10과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"4e7afed707\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;unsere&quot;],[&quot;sie&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">16.</strong> Kennst du <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(wir · 소유관사)</span> Lehrerin? – Ja, ich kenne <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(sie · 인칭대명사)</span> gut.</div><div class=\"qko\">너 우리 선생님 알아? – 응, 그분 잘 알아.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Kennst du <b>unsere</b> Lehrerin? – Ja, ich kenne <b>sie</b> gut.</div>Lehrerin은 여성 4격 → unsere. 여성 4격 인칭대명사는 sie예요 (4·8과).</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qscore\" data-total=\"16\" data-no-print><div class=\"qscore-t\">맞힌 문제 <b class=\"qscore-n\">0</b> / 16</div><div class=\"qscore-bar\"><i></i></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"all\">모두 다시 풀기</button></div>\n<div class=\"brand-foot\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"foot-logo\"><div class=\"foot-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div><div class=\"foot-tag\">Innovative Learning Beyond the Traditional</div></div>"